   "text": "Trader Holly: Welcome, friend! How do you like Aden? Let me tell you, though: it might look splendid on the outside, but it is beset by many complicated problems within. If those greedy nobles and their military lackies who are after the throne aren't dealt with quickly, this whole land could fall …",
